  "system": {
    "description": "<p><i><em style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">The philospher's stone is a mystical object made from the essence of creation itself. It can form all materials when used by an alchemist.</em></i></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">While within 1 mile of the stone, the bound Being does not age and can't be Sickened.</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">The stone is an alchemical item that can be used with the Use Action in the following ways, which consumes the Philosopher's Stone in the process:</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• If it touches a corpse, it is revived, and heals, creates, or regenerates their body to its original form if the Fates allow.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• It provides up to 50g of raw materials suitable for making an alchemical item. These raw materials disappear after 1 week of their creation.</span></p>",
